  lines:
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: Told you it wouldn't fit. Luckily, someone - me - packed the oversize spare.
  - speaker: Good Luck (radio)
    text: We carry exactly one, so that's the budget spent. Whole rock, full context,
